					 Sealer of Weights and Measures 
				 
				 The Sealer of Weights and Measures in East Bridgewater ensures accuracy in commercial weighing and measuring devices to protect both consumers and businesses. 
				
			 			 
				 
					 Tax Collector / Treasurer / Employee Benefits 
				 
				 The Tax Collector / Treasurer / Employee Benefits Office in East Bridgewater manages the collection of local taxes, oversees the town’s financial accounts, and administers employee benefit programs for municipal staff. 
				
			 			 
				 
					 Town Administrator 
				 
				 The primary duty of the Town Administrator is the day-to-day administration of the general government and to assist in the formulation and implementation of policy. 
				
			 			 
				 
